      "content": "Please stop thinking that \"selfishness\" is a valid way to escape the pain you feel right now; no one should be the reason for themselves to suffer, but you also shouldn't accept the idea that you can \"disappear\" to fix everyone else's life. Your feelings of guilt are a common and heavy burden in your situation, but they do not mean you are a bad person for struggling to cope. You deserve help to navigate these difficult thoughts so you don't end up feeling that no one wants you to just walk away.",
